# Climatic Mysteries — unpack camera (do not rewrite)

## Why this rule exists

Each agent pass kept **replacing the whole camera system** (scale-only → bbox math → object-position pan). That undid prior tuning and made the beat worse. **Tune in place; do not re-architect** unless the owner explicitly asks for a new approach in that conversation.

## Locked approach (live `app.html`)

- **Pan:** none (no `object-position` tricks on focus).
- **Zoom:** `transform-origin` at mask centroid + `scale()` only in `focusUnpackItem`.
- **Scale (committed zoom-in):** **1.95–2.15** per item. Higher = closer / softer pixels. Do not drop back to ~1.3 without owner asking.
- **Filters on focus:** none (no brightness boost while zoomed).
- **Coordinates:** centroids from `assets/scenes/unpack_masks/*.png` on `rental_unpack_scene.png` (1536×1024).

Current centroids (percent of art):

| id | x | y | scale |
|----|---|---|-------|
| duffel | 49.2 | 78.3 | 2.05 |
