| keys | 19.7 | 40.0 | 2.00 |

## Allowed edits (one at a time)

1. Change **one** item’s `x`, `y`, or `scale` in `UNPACK_OBJECTS`.
2. Or tweak **one** CSS line under `#prologue-bus-frame.rental-unpack.item-focused`.

**Not allowed** without owner asking to redesign: new helper layers, dynamic zoom from bbox, object-position pan, max scale above 1.4, deleting `unpack_masks/`.

## Workflow so Cursor stops undoing good work

1. **Owner says a version feels right** → they (or agent when asked) **git commit** with a message like `cm: unpack camera baseline ok`.
2. **Experiments** → copy to `climaticMysteries/overhaul/app.html` first; promote via manifest only when owner says ship overhaul.
3. **Owner feedback** → name the **one** item and direction (e.g. “keys a little more left”, “less zoom on bottle”) — not “fix the camera again”.
4. If reverting, restore from **last commit** or this rule’s table — do not invent a third camera system.

## Deploy

After live `climaticMysteries/app.html` changes: `bash climaticMysteries/scripts/deploy.sh` (not kids-sites deploy).
